editor_description = "Meshy model (docs/meshy.md, Model library): assets/third_party/meshy/cottage, drawn by the Model node. Attach points: SmokeOut (the chimney top; the Smoke particles hang from it) and the two window glows (WindowUpper, WindowLower; the model's glass is dark, so the glow is ours, with WindowLight). The greybox shows when the art is missing."

